{"title": "缓存键缺 query string：数据串号", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "# 错：proxy_cache_key 用 $uri（不含参数）"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost:8084/api/?id=1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "DATA for id=1"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -D - -o /dev/null \"localhost:8084/api/?id=2\" | grep X-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: HIT"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "DATA for id=1   <- ?id=2 拿到的是 id=1 的数据"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "对照：正确键 $request_uri 下 ?id=2 正常 MISS 返回 id=2"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测：nginx:1.28-alpine 容器（nginx/1.28.0）"}
]}
